subtitle: <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ z_party_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>[? if dvp_exist:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">**DVP**</span>?] + **その他** ([+ center_right_coalition_prussia +]%)
